    "rule_note": "two frequencies: the feet cos(limbSwing * 1.5F) x PI x 0.75 x limbSwingAmount (period 2 pi / 1.5 = 4.19 ticks at limbSwing +1 per tick; Robot1GeoReplacement.java:36-40, ModelRobot1.java:215-219; orig ModelRobot1.java:215-217 reads f2 = ageInTicks there) and the five keys toRadians(ageInTicks * 0.75) (one turn per 480 ticks; Robot1GeoReplacement.java:42-47, ModelRobot1.java:221-226; orig :218-222); the slowest group's period 480 ticks exceeds the 6 s cap (120 ticks): a two-second window (40 ticks), not a loop - the sheet states the closing key's seam",
